  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf1ce26f351eaaa4f9e8c51890ff0ea9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Red vs Blue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  description: 'Read this out loud to everyone at the party:


    Please pause all
    activities for a moment.


    For the next hour, the party will be split into
    two teams: a red team and a blue team. All marks collected during this time will
    not go towards individual player scores; instead, they will contribute to an
    overall team score. At the end of this hour, every player on the winning team
    may claim a prize from the prize pool.


    The teams are as follows:


    Red

    -
    Annalisa

    - Celine

    - Ethan

    - Kendra

    - Sam Suite

    - Simon


    Blue

    -
    Cameron

    - Jake

    - Nic

    - Sam Strathman

    - Spirit

    - Story

    -
    Takoda


    If your name isn''t on this list, you can choose whichever team
    you like.


    Sam will give out colored wristbands to denote teams. Once you
    get your wristband, you can continue whatever you were just doing. Good luck!'
